.TH KITPRO-HELPER 8 "September 2026" "KITPro Server" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
kitpro-helper \- confined privileged helper for KITPro Server
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kitpro-helper --version
.br
.B kitpro-helper --verify-host-prerequisites
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B kitpro-helper
accepts only typed KITPro operations from the authenticated API service UID over
a Unix socket. It uses the host's selected Docker or Podman adapter and never
accepts arbitrary runtime requests or shell commands. It is normally
socket-activated by systemd and confined by the host security adapter.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --verify-host-prerequisites
On Supported Docker hosts, verify that the administrator configured a
non-overlapping default address pool with sufficient available network
capacity. This check is read-only and never changes Docker configuration.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /var/lib/kitpro-helper/helper.db
Trusted ownership and receipt database.
.TP
.I /run/kitpro/helper.sock
Root-owned helper socket accessible to the kitpro-api group.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kitpro-api (8)
